{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "465bdfe4a5e00cc17b95a2344b10b0a490c86d674f8ccb8dd4fd96377e23e213", "ja": "（百合子の新しい衣装が完成し、さっそく試着して\nもらっている。気に入ってくれるといいが……）", "zh": "（百合子的新服装做好了，现在正让她试穿。希望她会喜欢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "5c1411d0c69ef9c0b96997af295453e0ea774451dae1606208c50cc3286022c9", "ja": "はぁっ……どうして、どうしてこんな……。\n……ぐすっ。", "zh": "哈啊……为什么，为什么会变成这样……  \n……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1002_p", "source_sha256": "bf884fa3bcc5c10a89c179dbd908e3b4ba306a844635958a856ddb4071fdb8d1", "ja": "ゆ、百合子？　大丈夫か？", "zh": "百、百合子？没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "b393b7ee0af57cca659252024b0097185ef64242d260001c5e0ec51ded283214", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nち、違うんです！　これはその……平気です！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n不、不是的！这个……我没事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1004_p", "source_sha256": "aebd1bb315443c9fc21b549c4df1dcc878c8d096f8ee3e6d3806950afc6c0ec7", "ja": "平気って、泣きそうになってるじゃないか……。\nもしかして、衣装に感動したから、とかか？", "zh": "你说没事，这不是都快哭出来了吗……\n难道说，是因为被服装感动到了之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1005_026yur", "source_sha256": "29fe162540c12a883df78b61759fe0a99827c7a2fb8386ea0b2471c4b0b069c9", "ja": "あ、ええと……そうではなくて。\nいえ、うれし泣きしそうになったのは事実ですけど！", "zh": "啊，那个……不是这样的。\n不，虽然确实是高兴得差点哭出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "241e0a7bb1e8c93e1db8f31477cefed8496f779b32b0e9d7b37de1671574a0ab", "ja": "実は……この衣装のことを考えていたら、\n切なくなってきてしまって。", "zh": "其实……我一想到这套服装，\n心里就难受了起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fef17b83b92db07fca8f69a0f9fde00b6f301b00b925c44acaecfb73c68d75bd", "ja": "衣装が……切ない？", "zh": "衣装……让你感到心酸？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "d34c453ecd5bd14603960d2b6a3fea91f2f0c0e565eb50f043743957312ba902", "ja": "この衣装は……人ならざる者の服なんです。\n帰らぬ想い人を待ち焦がれる、悲しい恋の象徴……。", "zh": "这套服装……是非人之物的服装。\n象征着苦苦等待着一去不返的心上人的悲恋……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "2b5c53d99339efe8703600e8b37b565cb5e5749bbee9924a9d3b8e2f68043774", "ja": "悠久の時を生きる彼女にとって、人の一生はあまりにも\n短い。もしかしたら、彼女の想い人はもう……。", "zh": "对那位长生不老的她而言，人的一生实在太过短暂。说不定，她思念的人已经……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "8064a360263ae07d2746292e42cdacbef1380edf7ae7c5c1c42aa9c161c3c018", "ja": "そんなことを思ったら……\n私、なんだか涙が出そうになっちゃって……。", "zh": "一想到那些事……\n我就不知怎么的，眼泪都快掉下来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1011_p", "source_sha256": "0cf30ecf69f47994ab10fcf9e3685b4c7cc6a4776a5bebcdc72a1512e0f50464", "ja": "なるほど……撮影用の衣装だから、\nバックストーリーがあるんだったな。", "zh": "原来如此……因为是用于拍摄的服装，\n所以才会有背景故事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "10f9f488106f87c8dfd2edc34821dab74264663734658327b7a583bd163f92da", "ja": "そうなんです！　花のモチーフひとつひとつにも、\nいろんな意味が込められてるって聞いて……。", "zh": "就是这样！听说连每一个花朵图案，都蕴含着各种各样的意义……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_026yur0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_026yur0244_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ec8173f00b38809819d98e1058c73a4059ecc768cec16dda9bd2d3204236a099", "ja": "そうだな、発注したときから、\nコンセプトは色々あったよ。たとえば……。", "zh": "是啊，从下单的时候起，就已经有各种各样的设计理念了。比如……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
